* University press release: {{#invoke:Cite |news |date=2 May 2023 |title=Single-Molecule Valve: A Breakthrough in Nanoscale Control |work=[[Osaka Metropolitan University]] |url=https://www.omu.ac.jp/en/info/research-news/entry-27753.html |access-date=8 May 2023}}</ref>
