cess-date=27 July 2023}}</ref> – and that this "hinders effective regulation of the societal harms AI is causing right now" and in the near-future.<ref>{{#invoke:Cite |journal |title=Stop talking about tomorrow's AI doomsday when AI poses risks today |journal=Nature |date=27 June 2023 |volume=618 |issue=7967 |pages=885–886 |language=en |doi=10.1038/d41586-023-02094-7|pmid=37369844 |bibcode=2023Natur.618..885. |s2cid=259254557 |doi-access=free }}</ref>
